  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EU - Technical Assistance for Agri-Food Systems (TAAS)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective is to reduce poverty by supporting the implementation of the RNR Sector&apos;s 12th Five Year Plan (FYP - 2018-2023) and 13th FYP (2023 to 2028). The specific objectives are to foster economic diversification and circularity of the RNR sector, sustainable management and conservation of natural resources, and enhanced food and nutrition security.</narrative>
  </description>
